{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"國務院免去何永賢房屋局局長職務\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/HO-LEFT-261103-12.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】國務院免去何永賢房屋局局長職務。</p><p>新華社報道，根據行政長官李家超的建議，國務院決定免去何永賢的房屋局局長職務。</p><p>何永賢上周三向李家超請辭，表示願意就宏福苑火災承擔政治責任，獲李家超接納，有關職務現時由財政司副司長黃偉綸兼任。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T05:03:28.619907+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T04:16:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T04:59:22.035835+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T04:59:22.035835+00:00","content_hash":"b1751dea23b985eada9c890fe76726104a93d5264f7de3d60901c732115fbee9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}